      "writtenOn": "2026-03-16T11:10:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I understand why kasan and alloc. But why the others?\n\nAlso perhaps put it up in the ifeq so we understand the context better.",
      "revId": "09fbdb92acebadde2b9c6df3d1a7b9a7b7296144",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
